      "ja": "まで徹底的に再現！小さいながらも圧巻の存在感！",
      "en": "Thoroughly reproduced! Although small, it has an overwhelming presence!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "複数体飾りたくなるコレクション性の高い手のひらサイズ。複数揃えれば、劇中の迫力ある行軍シーンをイメージして楽しめます！",
      "en": "A highly collectible palm-sized item that you'll want to display multiple pieces. If you collect more than one, you can enjoy imagining the powerful marching scene in the play!"
